WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.667
Today is Friday.

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.668
Happy Friday, everybody.

00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:05.805
Hope you have a great weekend.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.339
Friday is usually when
I catch up

00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:08.508
on some personal stuff,
you know.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.944
I check my inbox,
of course, on Fridays.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.879
I return some e-mails,
and of course,

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.113
I write out thank you notes.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:17.316
Well, I was running --

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:20.553
I was running a bit late --
running behind today.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.587
What's that?

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:22.955
-You were really
running behind today?

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:24.423
-Yeah, I was running
behind today,

00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:27.226
so I just didn't get around
to doing my thank you notes.

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:28.728
-What were you doing?

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:31.030
-Oh, I was, um...

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.466
I was teaching myself
new skateboard tricks

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:37.337
with those finger skateboards,
remember that?

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:40.440
So -- Hours.
-Hours.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.674
-Yeah, I mastered it.
-Ollie, Ollie!

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.676
Ollie. Yeah.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.044
I was just wondering if you guys
wouldn't mind --

00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:46.745
could I write out my weekly
thank you notes right now?

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:49.215
Is that --

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.017
I'll take that as a yes.

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:53.753
James can I get some thank you
note-writing music, please?

00:00:53.753 --> 00:01:02.594 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:02.594 --> 00:01:05.064
Thank you, "Loki" poster,

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.500 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.068
For looking like
you were designed by someone

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:11.271
who got their start
making ransom notes.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:17.644
"Meet me at the docks
at midnight?"

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:19.645
-Loki.

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:20.880 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.415
Thank you, Lucky Charms,

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:27.086
for partnering with Marvel
to release Loki Charms.

00:01:27.086 --> 00:01:32.058
Although personally,
I can't wait for Groot Loops.

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:36.029
-Nice one. Nice one.
-Groot Loops.

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:37.563
-Very nice.

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:38.731 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.734
Thank you, "The Bachelorette",
for being a show

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:45.271
where a bunch of guys show
you exactly why they're single.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.476
No.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:55.347
"Hi, I'm Tad G,
I'm an entrepreneur."

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:56.449
-Yeah.
-Wow.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:57.783
-Yeah
-You, too?

00:01:57.783 --> 00:01:58.618
-You, too? All of you?

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.753
-All of us are entrepreneurs.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.522
-And you only share five names.

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.356
That's a good --
-Yeah, we went --

00:02:04.356 --> 00:02:07.427
This is the Tad season.
-Yeah.

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.595
-You must be talking about
Tad D.

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:10.163
-No, Tad J. I was talking about.

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.097
-The entrepreneur?

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.131
-Yeah.

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:13.199
-Oh, yeah, you're right.
That is Tad J.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:15.535
-Yeah, that's him, bro.

00:02:15.535 --> 00:02:16.836 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:19.305
Thank you
"Springsteen on Broadway" --

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.840
coming back!

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:26.412
For being one of the best
shows to get tickets for

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:30.316
and the worst show
to be an understudy for.

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.984
"Ladies and gentlemen, tonight,

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:35.688
the role of Bruce Springsteen
will be played by Terry."

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:40.626
-Hey!

00:02:40.626 --> 00:02:44.797
One, two --
one, two, three and four.

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:47.934
♪ I grew up on
the streets of Jersey ♪

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:51.971
♪ And I didn't know much,
so I went to Mersey ♪

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:56.008
♪ And over in London
things were pretty hectic ♪

00:02:56.008 --> 00:02:58.711
And -- I can't.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:02.715
♪ Didn't expect it -- ♪
expect it?

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.717
♪ Didn't expect it. ♪
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:08.054
-♪ You wanted Bruce,
but it's me, Terry ♪

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:10.689
♪ You didn't expect it ♪
Right?

00:03:10.689 --> 00:03:12.958
-Yeah. Keep it going.

00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:14.760
-Sure. Sure.
-Yeah.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.128
Yeah, of course. Great.

00:03:16.128 --> 00:03:17.897
Yeah, Jimmy you're great.

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:20.900
Jimmy, everything's cool.
What you did out there

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.568
rapping was so awesome.

00:03:22.568 --> 00:03:24.037
Don't check the internet.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:29.275
-Don't. Seriously, don't.

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:30.910
No --
-It was great.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:31.744
-Give me your phone.
-It was so funny.

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:32.978
-Oh my God. I loved it.

00:03:32.978 --> 00:03:34.847
-What you did -- that rap,
when you improvised,

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:36.582
oh, that just did --
That was so good.

00:03:36.582 --> 00:03:38.250
Don't check the Internet.
Just stay away.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:39.185
Stay away for the weekend.

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:41.220
Just stay away from it.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:42.555
What do you care, right?
-Yeah.

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:44.590
-What do you care?
-What you did was interesting.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:47.226
-Yes. I loved it.

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:48.794
I just want to say that.

00:03:48.794 --> 00:03:53.833
-I've never -- I've seriously
never heard anything like it.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.734
Like, I never heard anything
like it.

00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:57.670
-Ever. Ever.
-Ever.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.539
And I've been working
in the business for a long time

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:03.508
and I've never heard anything
like what you just did.

00:04:03.508 --> 00:04:04.777
Don't check the Internet.

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:06.245
Don't read the --
Don't pick up the phone.

00:04:06.245 --> 00:04:08.414
If anyone calls you,
don't pick it up.

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:10.850
-Yes.
-Why would you answer anything?

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:14.153
Just take the weekend. Get on --
Do you have a hammock?

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:15.354
Lay on --
-Do you have an island?

00:04:15.354 --> 00:04:16.756
Do you have a place where you
get no reception?

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:18.490
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.859
And island?
-Yeah, an island

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:21.160
or something like that.
Just go there.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.728
You know what I mean?
-Like, you have like a cave?

00:04:22.728 --> 00:04:25.231
Is there a cave
you want to, like, explore?

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:26.566
Go spelunk.
-Spelunk, man.

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:28.501
-Dude, this is the weekend
for spelunking.

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:31.270
Go check out the cave
and just get in there man.

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.639
And don't get out
until Monday.

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:35.541
-You have any
Bose soundproof headsets?

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.276
-Yeah. How about the box
it came in?

00:04:37.276 --> 00:04:39.311
Put the box over your head.

00:04:39.311 --> 00:04:41.314
Don't look at anything,
don't listen to anything.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:43.549
But what you did was --
[ Smooches ]

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:46.385
I mean -- Whatever that means,
you know.

00:04:46.385 --> 00:04:47.886
Please don't -- Please
don't ever do it again.

00:04:47.886 --> 00:04:49.655
You know, could be whatever.
-Yeah.

00:04:49.655 --> 00:04:51.624
-Don't -- Don't try to replicate
it because it was...

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:52.591
mmm.

00:04:52.591 --> 00:04:54.393
-No, I would say
don't do it again.

00:04:54.393 --> 00:04:55.461
-Because --
-Because it was too --

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:57.597
-It was what it was.
-Yeah.

00:04:57.597 --> 00:04:59.832
-And -- And if you
do it again, why?

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:01.100
You know.
-You did it.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.234
-That's just my advice.
-You did it.

00:05:02.234 --> 00:05:05.070
-You definitely --
You did --

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:09.608
You did it. [ Laughs ]

00:05:09.608 --> 00:05:11.077 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:13.545
Thank you, summer,
for being the time

00:05:13.545 --> 00:05:16.348
