the year of the chin swing.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.935
Chin swing.

00:05:40.405 --> 00:05:41.907
-We're good?
-Oh, I knew.

00:05:41.907 --> 00:05:44.277
I'm wearing this for warmth.
-100%.

00:05:46.378 --> 00:05:47.646 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:47.646 --> 00:05:50.315
Thank you, wedding invitations
for letting me

00:05:50.315 --> 00:05:52.985
