holding hands with some dude

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.457
I've never met.

00:05:59.925 --> 00:06:01.861
You guys look happy.
-Every day.

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:04.797 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:04.797 --> 00:06:07.266
Thank you, hockey,
for being invented

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:09.035
